From 7cd094737342e21cf9a74ce779d018ab22fa1369 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 16:55:07 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Theme: Q Intelligence theme, Manrope, QCore/QStatus/Glass,
 Wellness card on the new look

- theme/tokens.ts + new default theme 'q' (existing themes untouched; saved choices preserved)
- Manrope font files (Android res/font) and typography switch
- QCore (6 states), QStatus, Glass, useReduceMotion: core Animated API, no new native deps
- WellnessCard rebuilt around QCore; readable text sizes; no hardcoded neon blue
- Tests for the new components; docs/THEME.md
